// Agents: info, read permissions, exposure modes, selection.

%locale: 
%namespace: agent

exposure.attachments: Attachments
exposure.attachments.hint: Expose attachments from this agent's messages to other agents.
exposure.content: Content
exposure.content.hint: Expose the main content/text of this agent's messages to other agents.
exposure.messages_with_tool_calls: Messages with tool calls
exposure.messages_with_tool_calls.hint: Expose messages that contain tool calls. If disabled, such messages may be hidden entirely from other agents.
exposure.reasoning: Reasoning
exposure.reasoning.hint: Expose the reasoning/thoughts of this agent to other agents.
exposure.tool_calls: Tool calls
exposure.tool_calls.hint: Expose tool calls and their results from this agent to other agents.
info.clear_image: Clear image
info.custom_model: Custom model
info.custom_model.hint: The custom model used by this agent. If not set, the chat's default model is used.
info.description: Description
info.description.hint: Provide a brief description of the agent's role and purpose. This helps other agents understand when to delegate tasks.
info.description.placeholder: Enter agent description...
info.identify_as_user: Identify as user
info.identify_as_user.hint: When enabled, this agent identifies itself as a user to other agents. Its messages are treated as user messages and its tool calls and reasoning become inaccessible to other agents.
info.name.hint: Set a custom name for this agent. This name is used in the agent list and in the chat.
info.name.placeholder: Enter agent name...
info.profile_image: Profile image
info.profile_image.hint: Paste a base64-encoded image to use as the agent's avatar.
info.select_image: Select image
perm.identify_agents_as_users: Identify agents as users
perm.identify_agents_as_users.hint: Other agents will be visible and treated as user messages to this agent.
perm.messages_with_tool_calls: Messages with tool calls
perm.messages_with_tool_calls.hint: Agent can read messages that contain tool calls from other agents. If disabled, messages with tool calls are filtered out.
perm.other_agent_attachments: Other agent attachments
perm.other_agent_attachments.hint: Agent can read attachments from other agents.
perm.other_agent_content: Other agent main content
perm.other_agent_content.hint: Agent can read main message's content from other agents.
perm.other_agent_messages: Other agent messages
perm.other_agent_messages.hint: Agent can read messages from other agents.
perm.other_agent_reasoning: Other agent reasoning
perm.other_agent_reasoning.hint: Agent can read the reasoning/thoughts of other agents.
perm.other_agent_tool_calls: Other agent tool calls
perm.other_agent_tool_calls.hint: Agent can read tool calls and results from other agents.
perm.own_messages: Own messages
perm.own_messages.hint: Agent can read its own previous messages.
perm.user_attachments: User attachments
perm.user_attachments.hint: Agent can read files attached by the user.
perm.user_messages: User messages
perm.user_messages.hint: Agent can read messages sent by the user.
selection.task: Agent selection
